        "text": "The Employee agrees and undertakes that at all times during the term of his Employment and thereafter\non termination of his Employment for whatever reason to hold in the strictest confidence, and not to\nuse, except for the benefit of the Company and its Affiliates, and absolutely refrain from in any manner\ndivulging, discussing, disclosing the Confidential Information to any third party or in any manner\ndirectly or indirectly using the Confidential Information without the written authorisation of the\nCompany.",
        "answer_start": 8302,
        "answer_end": 8816,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC048-0022"
      },
      {
        "text": "“Confidential Information” shall mean and includes information which is confidential including\nProprietary Information and other information related to the business of the Company, its affiliates or any\nthird parties with which the Company associates, whether or not such information is expressly marked or\ndesignated as confidential information and includes but is not limited to:",
        "answer_start": 2756,
        "answer_end": 3137,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC048-0012"
      }
    ],
    "is_impossible": false,
    "gold_paragraph_ids": [
      "PAR-DOC048-0012",
      "PAR-DOC048-0022"
    ],
    "doc_origin": "collected_real",
