        "answer_end": 20669,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC064-0053"
      },
      {
        "text": "If the Contract declares the subject matter of this Contract as coming under\nthe Official Secrets Act, 1923 or if the contract is marked as “Secret”, the\nContractor shall take all reasonable steps necessary to ensure that all\npersons employed in any work in connection with the contract, have full\nknowledge of the Official Secrets Act and any regulations framed\nthereunder.",
