        "text": "If the CONTRACTOR refuses or fails to execute the WORK or any separate part thereof with such diligence as will ensure its\ncompletion within the time specified in the CONTRACT or extension thereof or fails to perform any of his obligation under the\nCONTRACT or in any manner commits a breach of any of the provisions of the CONTRACT it shall be open to the EMPLOYER at\nits option by written notice to the CONTRACTOR:",
