    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "category_id": "CAT-019",
    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"Cap on Liability\". Details: Is there a cap on liability or a time limit for bringing claims under this contract?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC067-CAT019",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "LIMITATION OF LIABILITY Notwithstanding anything contrary contained herein, the aggregate total liability of CONTRACTOR\nunder the Agreement or otherwise shall be limited to 100% of Agreement / Contract Value. However, neither party shall be\nliable to the other party for any indirect and consequential damages, loss of profits or loss of production.",
