  {
    "qa_id": "IND-Q-01829",
    "doc_id": "DOC-067",
    "category_id": "CAT-021",
    "question": "Does anyone have to buy insurance under this contract?",
    "question_register": "semi_formal",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC067-CAT021",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "The Contractor shall take out insurance policy in the joint name of EMPLOYER and Contractor from one or more\nnationalised insurance company from any branch office at Project site.",
        "answer_start": 174958,
        "answer_end": 175137,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0210"
      },
      {
        "text": "The policy shall cover third party liability. The third party (liability shall cover the loss/ disablement of human life\n(person not belonging to the Contractor) and also cover the risk of damage to others materials/ equipment/\nproperties during construction, erection and commissioning at site. The value of third party liability for\ncompensation for loss of human life or partial/full disablement shall be of required statutory value but not less than\nRs. 2 lakhs per death, Rs. 1.5 lakhs per full disablement and Rs. 1 lakh per partial disablement and shall nevertheless\ncover such compensation as may be awarded by Court by Law in India and cover for damage to others equipment/\nproperty as approved by the Purchaser.",
        "answer_start": 173897,
        "answer_end": 174618,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC067-0210"
      }
    ],
