    "category_id": "CAT-021",
    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"Insurance\". Details: Is either party required to maintain insurance?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC068-CAT021",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "OWNER/CONSULTANT shall have covered by storage-cum-erection insurance\npolicies EQUIPMENT, materials supplied by OWNER / CONSULTANT,\nOWNER/CONSULTANT'S construction equipment, WORK executed at SITE and\nOWNER/CONSULTANT'S personnel. These policies apply only to insurance\nrisks at SITE and no other location.",
