    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"No-Solicit of Employees\". Details: Is there a restriction on soliciting or hiring the other party's employees?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC069-CAT009",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "No Engineer of Gazetted rank or other Gazetted officer employed in Engineering orAdministrative\nduties in the Engineering Department of the Government of India shall workas a Contractor or\nemploy of contractor for a period of one year after his retirement fromGovernment service without\nthe previous permission of Government of India in writing.This contract is liable to be cancelled if\neither the Contractor or any of his employees isfound at any time to be such a person who had not\nobtained the permission of Governmentof India as aforesaid before submission of the tender or\nengagement in the Contractor’sservice as the case may be.",
