    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC070-CAT017",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "Interim RA Bills in the form of monthly running bills prepared by the contractor in soft as\nwell as Hard copies shall be based on the quantities executed and measured. The\nmeasurements accepted by the EPIL for corresponding item will be taken for payment.\n12.2. Billing - All the day to day maintenance work will be executed on the basis of the\ndemand received through Complaint Form/ Call Slips and payment will be made as per\nactual execution and as per certified measurement of the executed work at site.",
        "answer_start": 12149,
        "answer_end": 12656,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0033"
      },
      {
        "text": "The final bill will be submitted by the contractor within 90 days from the date of\nacceptance of completion of work accompanied by the following documents:",
