    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"Insurance\". Details: Is either party required to maintain insurance?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC070-CAT021",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "Contractor is required to take third party insurance cover for an amount of 5%(five percent)\nof Contract Value from an Approved Insurance Company for insurance against any\ndamage, injury or loss which may occur to any person or property including that of EPI,\narising out of the execution of the works or temporary works. Wherever required by EPI the\nContractor shall produce the policy or the policies of Insurance and the receipt of payment\nof the current premiums.",
        "answer_start": 19743,
        "answer_end": 20210,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC070-0050"
      }
