    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"Insurance\". Details: Is either party required to maintain insurance?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC071-CAT021",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "The RPD shall effect and maintain or cause to be effected and maintained, at its own\ncost and expense, throughout the Term of PPA, Insurances against such risks to keep\nthe RE Project in good condition and shall take Industrial All Risk insurance policy\ncovering risks against any loss or damage, with such deductibles and with such\nendorsements and co-insured(s), which the Prudent Utility Practices would\nordinarily merit maintenance of and as required under the Financing Agreements,\nImplementation and Support Agreement (if applicable) and under the applicable\nlaws. Further, RPD shall also ensure that necessary Insurance coverage is also\nmaintained for the thermal component as per the requirement and compliances of\napplicable laws.",
