        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0199"
      },
      {
        "text": "Either Party is entitled to raise any claim, dispute or difference of whatever\nnature arising under, out of or in connection with this Agreement (“Dispute”)\nby giving a written notice (Dispute Notice) to the other Party, which shall\ncontain:\n(a)\na description of the Dispute;\n(b)\nthe grounds for such Dispute; and\n(c)\nall written material in support of its claim.",
        "answer_start": 138072,
        "answer_end": 138435,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0199"
      }
    ],
