  {
    "qa_id": "IND-Q-02182",
    "doc_id": "DOC-072",
    "category_id": "CAT-017",
    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"Payment Terms & Schedule\". Details: What are the payment amounts, milestones, and due dates?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC072-CAT017",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "The SPD shall issue to SECI hard copy of a signed Monthly Bill/Supplementary Bill\nfor the immediately preceding Month/relevant period based on the issuance of Energy\nAccounts along with all relevant documents (payments made by SPD for drawal of\npower, payment of reactive energy charges, Metering charges or any other charges as\nper guidelines of SERC/CERC, if applicable.\n10.2.2  SPD may raise Monthly bill based on the provisional REA published at RPC of the\nBuying Entity, the final adjustments in bill, if any, may be done on the basis of the\nfinal REA along with Debit/Credit Note. The Monthly Bill amount shall be the\nproduct of the energy as per Energy Accounts and the Applicable Tariff.",
        "answer_start": 86296,
        "answer_end": 86991,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0129"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the event of delay in payment of a Monthly Bill by SECI beyond the Due Date, a\nLate Payment Surcharge shall be payable by SECI to the SPD on the outstanding\npayment, at the base rate of Late Payment Surcharge applicable for the period for the\nfirst month of default. “Base rate of Late Payment Surcharge\" means the marginal\ncost of funds based lending rate for one year of the State Bank of India, as applicable\non the 1st April of the financial year in which the period lies, plus five percent (500\nbps) and in the absence of marginal cost of funds based lending rate, any other\narrangement that substitutes it, which the Central Government may, by notification,\nin the Official Gazette, specify.\nThe Late Payment Surcharge shall be claimed by the SPD through the Supplementary\nBill.",
        "answer_start": 89261,
        "answer_end": 90048,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC072-0132"
      }
    ],
    "is_impossible": false,
    "gold_paragraph_ids": [
      "PAR-DOC072-0129",
      "PAR-DOC072-0132"
    ],
    "doc_origin": "collected_real",
    "tier": "A",
    "split": "core",
    "annotator_ids": [
      "Pushkar SHarma, lead of project"
    ],
    "annotation_pass": "P1-model-assisted",
    "model_assisted": true,
    "adjudicated": false,
    "jaccard_agreement": null,
    "annotator_notes": ""
  },
