  {
    "qa_id": "IND-Q-02317",
    "doc_id": "DOC-074",
    "category_id": "CAT-014",
    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"Termination for Cause\". Details: Can a party terminate this contract for cause, such as breach, default, or insolvency?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC074-CAT014",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "In the event the SPD is unable to commission the plant within the stipulated time\nperiod, or fails to supply power in terms of the PPA, or assigns or novates any of its\nrights or obligations contrary to the terms of the PPA, or repudiates the PPA, or\neffectuates a change in control or shareholding of its promoters in breach of the\nprovisions of the PPA, or commits any other acts or omissions as laid down in the\nPPA and is also unable to cure any of the aforesaid within the cure period, as may be\nprovided in the PPA, the SPD shall be construed to be in default.",
        "answer_start": 96959,
        "answer_end": 97525,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0201"
      },
      {
        "text": "then the\nSPD may terminate the PPA and at its discretion, require the defaulting NTPC to\neither (i) takeover the Project assets by making a payment of the termination\ncompensation equivalent to the amount of the debt due and the 110% (one hundred\nand ten per cent) of the adjusted equity as defined below, less Insurance Cover, if\nany, or, (ii) pay to the SPD, damages, equivalent to 6 (six) months, or balance PPA\nperiod, whichever is less, of charges for its contracted capacity, with the Project\nassets being retained by the SPD.",
        "answer_start": 99299,
        "answer_end": 99831,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC074-0203"
      }
    ],
    "is_impossible": false,
    "gold_paragraph_ids": [
      "PAR-DOC074-0201",
      "PAR-DOC074-0203"
    ],
    "doc_origin": "collected_real",
    "tier": "A",
    "split": "core",
    "annotator_ids": [
      "Pushkar SHarma, lead of project"
    ],
    "annotation_pass": "P1-model-assisted",
    "model_assisted": true,
    "adjudicated": false,
    "jaccard_agreement": null,
    "annotator_notes": ""
  },
