    "category_id": "CAT-012",
    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"IP Ownership Assignment\". Details: Does intellectual property created under this contract vest in or get assigned to one of the parties?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC076-CAT012",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "Documents and computer programs or copies thereof, if any, provided by the Concessioning\nAuthority to the Concessionaire, shall always remain the property of the Concessioning Authority.\nSuch documents, computer programs and/or copies shall not be used by the Concessionaire for\nthe purposes other than for the Project. Such documents, computer programs and/or copies thereof\nshall, unless otherwise agreed upon by the Concessioning Authority, be returned by the\nConcessionaire to the Concessioning Authority on the Transfer Date.",
