    "doc_id": "DOC-076",
    "category_id": "CAT-016",
    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"Dispute Resolution & Arbitration Seat\". Details: How are disputes under this contract resolved, and what is the arbitration seat or court jurisdiction?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC076-CAT016",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "les of\nSAROD - Ports. The detailed procedure for conducting Arbitration shall be governed by the Rules\nof SAROD - Ports and provisions of Arbitration & Conciliation Act, 1996, as amended fro",
        "answer_start": 241225,
        "answer_end": 241415,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC076-0539"
      },
      {
        "text": "The seat of Arbitration shall be New Delhi, or a place selected by the Governing Body of SAROD\n- Ports and the language for all documents and communications between the parties shall be\nEnglish.",
