    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC076-CAT025",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "“BIS” means Bureau of Indian Standards.\n“BS” means British Standard.\n“CISF” means Central Industrial Security Force.\n“DIN” means German Industrial Standard.\n“FEM” means Federation of Equipment Manufacturers.\n“GST” means Goods and Services Tax\n“IS” means Indian Standard.\n“ISO” means International Standards Organization.\n“IEC” means International Electro Technical Commission.",
