    "category_id": "CAT-012",
    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"IP Ownership Assignment\". Details: Does intellectual property created under this contract vest in or get assigned to one of the parties?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC080-CAT012",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "As between the Parties, the Authority shall retain the copyright and other intellectual\nproperty rights in this Agreement and other documents made by (or on behalf of) the\nAuthority. The Contractor may, at its cost, copy, use, and obtain communication of\nthese documents for the purposes of this Agreement.",
        "answer_start": 323892,
        "answer_end": 324198,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC080-0312"
      },
      {
        "text": "The Contractor shall be deemed\n(by signing this Agreement) to give to the Authority a non-terminable transferable\nnon-exclusive royalty-free licence to copy, use and communicate the Contractor's\ndocuments, including making and using modifications of them.",
