  {
    "qa_id": "IND-Q-02761",
    "doc_id": "DOC-085",
    "category_id": "CAT-016",
    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"Dispute Resolution & Arbitration Seat\". Details: How are disputes under this contract resolved, and what is the arbitration seat or court jurisdiction?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC085-CAT016",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "Any dispute or difference whatsoever arising between the parties to this Agreement\nout of or relating to the construction, meaning, scope, operation or effect of this\nAgreement or the validity of the breach thereof shall be referred to a sole Arbitrator\nto be appointed by mutual consent of both the parties herein. If the parties cannot\nagree on the appointment of the Arbitrator within a period of one month from the\nnotification by one party to the other of existence of such dispute, then the Arbitrator\nshall be appointed by the High Court where the Purchaser is located in India. The\nvenue",
        "answer_start": 104924,
        "answer_end": 105519,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC085-0173"
