    "doc_id": "DOC-086",
    "category_id": "CAT-024",
    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"O&M Period\". Details: Is there an operation and maintenance obligation, and what is its term?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC086-CAT024",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "During the Operation Period, the Concessionaire shall operate and maintain the XXX Ropeway\nin accordance with this Agreement either by itself, or through the O&M Contractor and if\nrequired, modify, repair or otherwise make improvements to the XXX Ropeway to comply with\nthe provisions of this Agreement, Applicable Laws and Applicable Permits, and conform to\nSpecifications and Standards and Good Industry Practice. The obligations of the Concessionaire\nhereunder shall include:",
        "answer_start": 160124,
        "answer_end": 160602,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0276"
      },
      {
        "text": "the exclusive right, licence and authority to construct, operate and\nmaintain the Project (the “Concession”) for a period of [30 (thirty)] years commencing from\nthe Appointed Date,",
        "answer_start": 56600,
        "answer_end": 56780,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC086-0100"
      }
    ],
    "is_impossible": false,
