    "question": "Highlight the parts (if any) of this contract related to \"Confidentiality Scope\". Details: What confidential information must be protected, and what is the obligation of confidentiality?",
    "question_register": "canonical",
    "intent_group_id": "IG-DOC087-CAT010",
    "answers": [
      {
        "text": "The Contractor shall take all precautions not to disclose, divulge and / or disseminate to any\nthird party any confidential information, proprietary information on the Client’s business or\nsecurity arrangements (including but not limited to the Assignment Instructions, Schedules\nand other subsequent Agreements) and/or business of the Client. The obligation is not limited\nto any scope and the Contractor shall be held responsible in case of breach of the\nconfidentiality of Client’s information.",
        "answer_start": 32738,
        "answer_end": 33235,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0118"
      },
      {
        "text": "Shall mean all information that is not generally known and which is obtained\n/received during the tenure of the contract and relates directly to the business\n/assets of Client including the information having the commercial value.",
        "answer_start": 32040,
        "answer_end": 32270,
        "paragraph_id": "PAR-DOC087-0117"
      }
    ],
    "is_impossible": false,
    "gold_paragraph_ids": [
      "PAR-DOC087-0117",
      "PAR-DOC087-0118"
    ],
    "doc_origin": "collected_real",
